Cottagecraft
============

Cottagecraft is a fork of Rustic Revived, itself a NeoForge port of Rustic (Minecraft 1.12.2).
The code and assets have been modified (renamed, retargeted to NeoForge 21.1.249, trimmed of some optional integrations).
Licensed under the MIT License (see LICENSE).

